    "body": "The thought did cross my mind at some point that XMLHttpRequest could not be unique in this, but you and Ian have been pretty consistent on where scripts get the base URL...\n\nSee also https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=27204.\n\n(I saw on IRC someone was concerned about WebSocket too, but WebSocket does not support a base URL so doesn't matter.)\n",
